From: z23 <3616196+z23@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Experimental default-off VA observer (incomplete lifetime contract)

Original observer by z23; maintainer fixes serialize handle lookup, bound
lock waits, reject unsupported writers, and guard surface destruction.
Not a completed observer or live-copy contract. See CONTRACT.md.

